## Development

Install dependencies:

```sh
{{#if (eq pythonPackageManager "poetry")}}
poetry install --extras dev
{{else if (eq pythonPackageManager "uv")}}
uv sync --extra dev
{{else}}
python -m venv .venv
pip install -e .
{{/if}}
```

Run the application:

```sh
{{#if (eq pythonWebFramework "fastapi")}}
{{#if (eq pythonPackageManager "poetry")}}poetry run {{else if (eq pythonPackageManager "uv")}}uv run {{/if}}uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port ${PORT:-8000}
{{else if (eq pythonWebFramework "streamlit")}}
{{#if (eq pythonPackageManager "poetry")}}poetry run {{else if (eq pythonPackageManager "uv")}}uv run {{/if}}streamlit run src/app/main.py
{{else if (eq pythonWebFramework "litestar")}}
{{#if (eq pythonPackageManager "poetry")}}poetry run {{else if (eq pythonPackageManager "uv")}}uv run {{/if}}litestar --app src.app.main:app run --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port ${PORT:-8000}
{{else}}
{{#if (eq pythonPackageManager "poetry")}}poetry run {{else if (eq pythonPackageManager "uv")}}uv run {{/if}}python -m app.main
{{/if}}
```
{{#if (eq pythonServer "gunicorn")}}

Production with Gunicorn:

```sh
{{#if (eq pythonPackageManager "poetry")}}poetry run {{else if (eq pythonPackageManager "uv")}}uv run {{/if}}{{#if (eq pythonWebFramework "aiohttp")}}gunicorn app.main:app --worker-class aiohttp.GunicornWebWorker{{else if (eq pythonWebFramework "django")}}gunicorn app.main:application{{else if (eq pythonWebFramework "flask")}}gunicorn app.main:app{{else}}gunicorn app.main:app --worker-class uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker{{/if}}
```
